"Unified retrieval searches campus documents, course outlines, syllabus, and "
"lecture notes via semantic and keyword search, providing citations with "
"direct source links."
msgstr ""
"Utafutaji wa pamoja hutafuta nyaraka za chuo, mihutasari ya kozi, silabasi "
